[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: A read-only HTTP endpoint owns each ephemeral export

[GRAMMAR]
IMPORT_FROM_FILE: @repo

[MECHANISM]
UID: MECH-SDOC-PERSPECTIVE-EXPORT-SERVER
TITLE: A read-only HTTP endpoint owns each ephemeral export
DEPTH: interface-settled
AUTHORED_BY: llm
STATEMENT: >>>
A standard-library HTTP server serves an allowlisted static UI and a GET-only data endpoint. For each data request it creates a TemporaryDirectory, runs strictdoc export on the repository root with JSON as the sole format, reads json/index.json, adapts it while the directory exists, and then lets the temporary directory clean itself. Export and schema failures become structured non-success responses.
<<<
